ottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l6 level2 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数据应用层规范</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(应用域的划分、应用库设计, ADS层命名规范( 公共规则,ADS表命名规则) );&nbsp;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:72.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 72.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l6 level2 lfo1;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ODS数据接入规范(ODS库命名规则、ODS表名及任务命名规则);</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2 数仓分层架构</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >模型一共分为</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3层：ODS -&gt; CDM -&gt; ADS。ODS和业务系统表结构一致；ADS为应用系统直接使用的表</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >；</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >C</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DM包括DIM/DWD -&gt; DWS，DWD为明细事实表，主要包括原子指标；DWS为汇总事实表，主要包括派生指标。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >清晰的层次，解决表间相互依赖的问题。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l7 level1 lfo2;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >指标和公共处理逻辑下沉到</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >CDM，解决重复建设和一致性问题。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3 数仓数据域划分</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(25,26,31);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >首先，在建设大数据数据仓库时，要进行充分的业务调研和需求分析。这个是数据仓库建设的基石，业务调研和需求分析做的是否充分直接决定了数据仓库建设是否成功。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(25,26,31);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >在进行需求分析阶段，需要沉淀出业务分析或报表中的指标，以及指标的定义，指标统计有哪些粒度。这些粒度就可作为维度的输入。然后，按照维度建模理论，构建总线矩阵抽象出业务过程和维度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(25,26,31);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >最后，进行物理模型的设计，进行代码研发和发布运维了。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(25,26,31);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >注：实施的各个环节，可能会随着对业务的熟悉或需求的变更有一定的反复和修正工作。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >但是在实际落地实施过程中，会遇到几个问题：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >业务板块、数据域怎么划分；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >总线矩阵应该长什么样，作用是什么；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l5 level1 lfo3;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >模型设计的原则大而泛，还是不知道怎么建模：到底有哪些表，每张表应该有哪些指标。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >目前没有有明确方法论，业务板块依据企业实际业务领域进行划分；数据域可以按照行业标准业务过程或者业务板块中的功能模块进行划分。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >传统行业经年积累或者按行业标准已经有一些划分，比如该钢铁行业客户，已有营销域、质量域、生产域、设备域、成本域等划分，营销域下面又细分物流、订单、结算、情报、客户、库存</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >6部分，可以作为营销域的子域。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >电商行业：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >日志域</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >(流量域),商品域,交易域,营销域，物流和快递域,广告域，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >搜索域，推荐域，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(38,38,38);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >会员和店铺域</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >,内容域；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >游戏行业：用户，游戏，广告，营收，频道，社区等</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >;</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4.总线矩阵</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >总线矩阵包含了数据域、业务过程和一致性维度。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >目的在于：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >维度一致性，让多数据域的统计维度一致，进而指标不会出现二义性；</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >维表尽量宽，把不同数据域相同维度下需要的属性都放在一张表里，空间换时间。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"503"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515301579.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><h1 style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >5.数仓模型设计</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:24.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:22.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></h1><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >有了这张总线矩阵，维表中的维度、属性能确定，但是和指标的关系没体现出来，模型仍无从入手。</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&nbsp; 到底总线矩阵应该长什么样，具体包含哪些元素，又如何依据这些元素实施建模呢？</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >下面以营销域物流子域一个小</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >demo，串一下从总线矩阵设计到数仓模型设计的实施过程，回答了每一层有哪些表，每张表包含哪些指标。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >&nbsp;ps: 这里的模型不包括ODS层，ODS层的表和源业务系统表保持一致，抽取策略和分区结合实际场景设计。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >1、总线矩阵</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(25,26,31);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >结合『自顶向下』和『自下而上』分析，梳理出的总线矩阵包括：数据域、业务过程、指标、维度以及原子指标对应的实体</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"140"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515302000.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >其中</font></span><b style=3D"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal" ><span class=3D"16"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20mso-ansi-font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >库存</font></span></b><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%91%A8%E8%BD%AC%E7%8E%87/1302972" ><b><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >周转率</font></span></b></a></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-weight:bold;font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >是在某一时间段内库存货物周转的次数。是反映库存周转快慢程度的指标。周转率越大表明销售情况越好</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >。在物料</font></span><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%BF%9D%E8%B4%A8%E6%9C%9F/10238647" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,56,132);" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >保质期</font></span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >及资金允许的条件下，可以适当增加其</font></span><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6/10703246" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,56,132);" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >库存控制</font></span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >目标天数，以保证合理的库存。反之，则可以适当减少其库存控制目标天数。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >公式如下：</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >时间段</font></span><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98%E5%91%A8%E8%BD%AC%E5%A4%A9%E6%95%B0/7651204" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,0,255);" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >库存周转天数</font></span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >=3D时间段天数X (1/2) X (</font></span><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%9C%9F%E5%88%9D%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98/7345191" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,56,132);" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >期初库存</font></span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数量</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >+</font></span><span><a href=3D"https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%9C%9F%E6%9C%AB%E5%BA%93%E5%AD%98/12668547" ><span class=3D"17"  style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;color:rgb(0,56,132);" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >期末库存</font></span></a></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >数量）</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >/时间段销售量；库存周转率=3D时间段天数/库存周转天数。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><br></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >2、指标层级关系</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;=20mso-list:l1 level1 lfo5;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >结合『总线矩阵』中原子指标、派生指标以及派生指标对应的维度，梳理出指标的层级关系以及派生指标的对应维度。</font></span><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >蓝色</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3个派生指标为都需要按基地、仓库、渠道公司维度进行统计，橙色4个指标都需要按仓库维度进行统计。</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"580"  height=3D"288"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515302993.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >3、DWD层设计</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"640"  height=3D"182"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515303151.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >结合『总线矩阵』中原子指标和实体的对应关系，相同实体的原子指标优先放在一张表中，依据粒度不同再拆开放在不同的表中。比如「材料重量」和「入库量」都属于材料实体，但是「材料重量」粒度</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >y为一个材料id只有一条记录，而「入库量」粒度为一个材料id会有多条记录，类似日志表。这2个原子指标粒度不一样，则放在不同的表中。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo6;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >原子指标衍生的派生指标，如果粒度一致，也放在</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DWD层。比如从『指标层级关系』看，「材料重量」衍生的3个派生指标「厂内产成品库存量」、「用户在库库存量」、「渠道在库库存量」的粒度都是一个材料id一行记录，则可以在DWD预计算好。</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4、DWS层设计</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"600"  height=3D"268"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515303579.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >直接来源于</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DWD表的派生指标且维度相同，放在一张DWS表。比如「厂内产成品库存量」、「用户在库库存量」、「渠道在库库存量」放在1张DWS表。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >再上层派生指标相同维度放在一张表。比如橙色的</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >4个指标，都是仓库维度，可以放到1张DWS表中。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l4 level1 lfo7;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:10.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >最上层</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >DWS冗余维度属性，将仓库维表的属性冗余进去。冗余后这张表的下游表可以直接用仓库维度的属性字段，而不用再去关联仓库维表。用适当存储冗余换计算效率。</font></span></b><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >5、ADS层设计</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3Dp  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span><img width=3D"468"  height=3D"188"  src=3D"~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}1051530.files/~tmp{2739aea1-b875-48d9-9657-1f6e5c7060a5}10515303933.png" ></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo8;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >依据应用系统需求设计</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >ADS表，将非公共、个性化的指标放在ADS层，比如排名、比率等。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"margin-top:5.0000pt;margin-bottom:5.0000pt;margin-left:36.0000pt;=20mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;text-indent:-18.0000pt;=20tab-stops:left blank 36.0000pt ;mso-pagination:widow-orphan;mso-list:l3 level1 lfo8;" ><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:10.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><span style=3D'mso-list:Ignore;' >&#183;<span style=3D'font:7.0pt Times New Roman' >&nbsp;</span></span></span><![endif]><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >公共指标迭代下沉到</font><font face=3D"微软雅黑" >CDM。如果发现ADS某个指标在其他地方也需要，则需要将该指标下沉到CDM。</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:微软雅黑;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p></div><!--EndFragment--></body></html>

